# Dependencies and build output
node_modules
out
dist
dist-electron

# The TypeScript compiler's incremental state: rebuilt every time and read by nobody.
*.tsbuildinfo

# Databases and profiles never belong in version control: they hold messages, contacts and
# credentials. Not even "just for testing".
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
profiles.json

# The throwaway check scripts IDEAS.md describes
verify-*.ts
verify-*.cjs
*-probe.ts
*-probe.cjs

# Private notes, not for publication
IDEAS.de.md

*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# The demo environment: its certificate and key, and what its mail server received.
scripts/demo/.state/

# The debug build's trust of the demo certificate (scripts/demo/trust.sh makes it). Never committed: it names a certificate that only this machine has.
apps/mobile/android/app/src/debug/

# The APK a release build puts together with its checksum.
dist-android/
